## Scale Estimation

```
Active drivers:  5M globally, 500K per large city
Active riders:   2M concurrent ride requests/peak
Location updates: Each driver sends location every 4 seconds
                  → 5M / 4 = 1.25M location updates/sec
Rides per day:  15M
Match latency:  < 10 seconds end-to-end
```

