## Driver Accept/Reject Endpoint

```java
@PostMapping("/api/v1/ride/{rideId}/respond")
public ResponseEntity<Void> respondToOffer(@PathVariable String rideId,
                                            @RequestParam String action, // ACCEPTED or REJECTED
                                            @AuthenticationPrincipal String driverId) {
    redis.opsForValue().set("driver:response:" + driverId + ":" + rideId,
                            action, Duration.ofSeconds(15));
    return ResponseEntity.ok().build();
}
