## Ride State Machine

```
REQUESTED → SEARCHING → DRIVER_ASSIGNED → DRIVER_EN_ROUTE
          → RIDER_PICKED_UP → IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED
          → CANCELLED (at any pre-pickup stage)
          → NO_DRIVER_FOUND
```

