## Non-Functional Requirements

| Concern | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| Driver location freshness | Redis GEO + 5s TTL on metadata |
| Double-match prevention | Redis `SETNX` driver lock with 15s TTL |
| Match latency < 10s | Pre-filtered candidates from Redis GEO, parallel offers |
| Driver offline detection | No location update in 30s → mark OFFLINE |
| Ride state durability | MySQL as source of truth, Redis as cache |
| High write QPS (location) | Redis Cluster, partition by city |

